{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳蕾展開全新音樂企劃，繼首波主打《人類愛情學》後，近日推出第二首全新作品《翻風》，由樂隊Pandora作曲及編曲、鍾說填詞、Pandora與舒文共同監製。</p><p>MV繼續找來老友 Gigi（張蔓姿）操刀執導，歌曲靈感源自陳蕾與鍾說的浪漫共識，描繪一位「分了手，卻極度瀟灑」的人，享受單身自由與世界美好爽快感覺。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:41:33.052845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:04:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.987802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:38:14.605467+00:00","content_hash":"c9674ddd58845d3203810cb7c312f86feb3a26c169fed85334dd29fbef009186","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}